    ACCUM CASE
        WHEN src.type == "Comment" THEN
            tgt.@commentCnt += 1
        WHEN src.type == "Post" THEN
            tgt.@postCnt += 1
        END;
----
<1> `Person` is a vertex type.
`(Comment | POST)` combines two vertex types.
